            "review_title": "Review at Béo Ơi Quán",
            "review_text": "karng\n305 contributions\n0\nA Taste of Local Comfort Food\nJul 2026 • Solo\nI got the sticky rice with various toppings (Xôi xéo thập cẩm). The sticky rice was chewy and flavorful, and the pork was tender, soft, and well-seasoned. Overall, the toppings worked really well with the rice, although the hard-boiled egg was a bit overcooked. The portion was also quite filling. I especially liked the fried young rice flakes patties (Chả cốm chiên). They were soft and chewy and made for a great snack alongside the sticky rice, but they were very oily. Dining at this restaurant made me feel very local.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 3, 2026",
